## Roughness and glossiness

Dedicated sensors would illuminate the surface from several controlled angles and measure the width and shape of the reflection lobe.

Possible hardware:

- multi-angle photometric array;
- polarisation camera;
- laser-scatter sensor;
- compact imaging gonioreflectometer;
- coherent speckle analysis.

