## Metallic and dielectric behaviour

This can be physically distinguished using:

- hyperspectral reflectance;
- polarisation response;
- angle-dependent specular colour;
- electrical or electromagnetic material sensors;
- terahertz or millimetre-wave reflectometry;
- eddy-current sensing for conductive materials.

